{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"0f847d157da858e226e4279ef6cb682b4b578260030a300870999afb8cd49f43","digest":{"component_or_area":"store write path (ticket directory creation)","key_entities":["_store/event_append.py::_prepare_event","_store/staging.py","_store/lock.py::_acquire_mkdir","_engine/rebar_reconciler/inbound_translate.py::_write_event_file","_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py","fsck.py::_scan","fsck.py::foreign_store_path_list",".tmp-newticket-<pid>-<uuid4hex>","StagedEvent.promote()","sweep_stale_staging","batch_stage_and_commit","_rollback_batch","os.makedirs","os.rename","os.replace"],"problem_keywords":["atomic directory creation","interrupted write","debris","store write","ticket directory","race condition"],"propositions":["Interrupted writes between makedirs and first event file create empty orphaned ticket directories that fsck reports as MISSING_CREATE and FOREIGN_STORE_PATH.","The shared _prepare_event function creates ticket directories outside the write lock before event files are written, making both single-event and batch paths vulnerable to debris on interruption.","Staging directories with dot-prefix naming convention (.tmp-newticket-*) are invisible to fsck scanners and existing ticket enumeration, enabling safe atomic directory+event publication via single os.rename under the write lock.","Stale staging directories from dead processes are bounded best-effort swept at writer start using process identity stamps, reclaiming only the writer's own staging area without touching store data or violating 043f (no writer-side cleanup of event-less ticket dirs)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787302425040967001,"uuid":"e8047e77-ac83-4fda-aa18-998539cbef15"}